The MintManager allows increasing the supply by a maximum of 2% once every 356 days. To maintain a consistent 2% increase every 365 days, the owner must call `mintTo` exactly every 356 days. If this is not done, the next minting period will be delayed because the next permitted mint time is set as `block.timestamp + MINT_PERIOD`.

